  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investments for green infrastructure and the Technical Advisory Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to strengthen the Somaliland government&apos;s capacity to deliver essential services with a strategic, evidence-based approach that prioritizes climate resilience, aligning with the International Climate Fund (ICF). In collaboration with government and development partners, the Danish-led Fund will support interventions in climate-smart agriculture, the blue economy, sustainable water management to provide potable water and renewable energy initiatives to reduce fuel dependency and lower energy costs. Additionally, a technical advisory facility will promote economic reform and donor coordination, address past shortcomings and ensuring long-term, transformative impact through stakeholder engagement and strategic planning.</narrative>
  </description>
